<title>USA: Transkaryotic names Daniel Geffken CFO.</title>
<headline>Transkaryotic names Daniel Geffken CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transkaryotic Therapies Inc said Friday it has named Daniel Geffken as chief financial officer and vice-president of finance.  Geffken was previously CFO at CytoTherapeutics Inc.</p>
<p>The company also has named Peter Wirth, executive vice-president at Genzyme Corp, as the fifth member of its board of directors, and promoted Douglas Treco to the position of senior vice-president for research and development.</p>
